		<!-- Content -->
		<div class="container"><h1>View the Spending Summary</h1>
<p>See how much you spent in each category, within a date range, and on tax-related purchases.</p>

<h3>Steps</h3>
<ol>
	<li>In the <strong>Receipt List</strong>, click <strong>View Summary</strong>.</li>
	<li><strong>Totals by Category</strong> shows the amount spent in each category.</li>
	<li>Under <strong>Total for Date Range</strong>, pick a <strong>Start</strong> and <strong>End</strong> date, then click <strong>Calculate</strong>. The total for receipts in that range appears below.</li>
	<li><strong>Tax-related Total</strong> shows the sum of all receipts marked Tax-related.</li>
	<li>Click <strong>Close</strong> to return to the Receipt List.</li>
</ol>
<img src="/images/summary.png" width="100%" alt="Spending Summary window with totals">

<p>In this example, Meals is $250.00 and Equipment is $600.00, the total from October 1 to October 18 is $850.00, and the tax-related total is $600.00.</p>
<p>Back to <a href="/docs">Documentation</a>.</p>
